    "notes": "The named relation contains the historic and parallel construction footprints. The PMTiles roadway, cycleway and shore joins align the original deck from Karkh to Rusafa. A short native transverse footway remains on the west approach. The model depicts the historic Al-Sarafiya crossing and approaches. The mapped relation also includes the separately built second span. Its outline remains in the source controls and its construction and future road alignment are outside this landmark replacement. Truss stations, pier dimensions, grades and painted details are exterior reconstructions from ordinary photos and the standard viewer terrain. The native river surface remains and exposed pier heights vary with the host water level."
  },
